{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07227","headline":"故女道士婉仪太原郭氏挽歌词 一 · 刘长卿","name":"故女道士婉仪太原郭氏挽歌词 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"作范宫闱睦，归真道艺超。\n驭风仙路远，背日帝宫遥。\n鸾殿空留处，霓裳已罢朝。\n淮王哀不尽，松柏但萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}